# Vauxhall Astra Mk3 five-door hatchback, 1991-1998.
#
# The third Astra: 4,050 mm long, 1,696 mm wide, 1,410 mm high, 2,517 mm
# wheelbase; 1.4-2.0 petrol and diesels. A top-three UK seller through the 1990s.
# https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Opel_Astra#Astra_F_(1991%E2%80%931998)
#
# Colours: Rioja Red, Star Silver, Diamond Black and Breeze Blue are period
# Vauxhall colours.
#
# Weight: 320 in total (blue 100, red 80, silver 80, black 60).
#
# Speed 170 km/h; comfort 105/488 (line). Classes 1,2.
# Dates: 1991-1998 with a road tail to about 2006.
#
# Metres master: citycars/4.5/vauxhall-astra-mk3.blend. References:
# citycars/references/vauxhall-astra-mk3/ (gitignored). Images via Wikimedia
# Commons.

